   100	`instant-notes bench --audio sample.wav --reference ref.txt` runs all configured
   101	backends and emits a table: backend × {total latency, first-token latency, WER,
   102	cost-estimate}. Markdown report saved under `docs/benchmarks/`.
   103	
   104	## 9. Stack / tooling
